# Keep the build context small. The Dockerfile copies only what the server
# needs, so this list is about not shipping the rest to the daemon.
#
# Deliberately not the exclude-everything-then-re-include form: that requires
# re-including each parent directory as well, and a missed one fails the build
# with a confusing missing-file error.

.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.superpowers/
docs/
firmware/
HomeAssistant/
RB3E WebUI/

Dashboard/tests/
Dashboard/build/
Dashboard/dist/
Dashboard/dashboard.py
Dashboard/dashboard.spec
Dashboard/requirements.txt

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
appdata/
